============ 2/24/26 - Mob Boss Ideas - Tori ============
If we go with a female Godfather...
True identity is only known by the upper brass of the Mafia. Only referred to as the Godfather or by the family name. Referred to with he/him pronouns. Assumed by mostly everyone to be a man.
Became the "Don" of the family quietly and strategically, didn't follow the traditional path. Was the daughter of the underboss (second hand) of the previous Godfather. Her father was the anointed successor and rose to power when the sitting Don died. She, in secret, assassinated her father and assumed his identity, continuing operation as normal under his name. 
She, as the new Godfather, maintained order and continued managing the "family business" for a few months unsuspected. Eventually it came out her father had died, but her control over the family had already become too strong to dismantle. Only the new underboss and consigliere know her identity, making any radical shifts to the family structure from unhappy Capos difficult. 
The Godfather runs the family with an iron fist, unseen, unheard, but always felt. Even an associate(? or maybe soldier? what is the MC's place in the family hierarchy?) like the MC knows what it means to cross the Godfather.
